WEBVTT

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:00.468
(Laughter)

00:03:00.468 --> 00:03:01.928
"Babe, it's so cool."

00:03:01.928 --> 00:03:03.262
(Laughter)

00:03:03.554 --> 00:03:06.807
There was no way she was going
to get me to look down there.

00:03:06.849 --> 00:03:09.477
The truth is, I couldn't bear to.

00:03:09.518 --> 00:03:11.562
Not because I couldn't stomach it,

00:03:11.604 --> 00:03:14.440
but because I couldn't accept
what had happened to me.

00:03:15.024 --> 00:03:16.651
This went on for months.

00:03:16.692 --> 00:03:19.028
At the time I was wheelchair-bound,

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:23.032
at home, my wife had to be there for me
every second of the day,

00:03:23.074 --> 00:03:24.909
even helping me to go to the bathroom.

00:03:25.493 --> 00:03:30.122
I spent most of my days sitting
propped up on the couch just thinking,